 Broiler.CSS.Dom.Tests/CssStyleEngineTests.cs | 110 ++++
 Broiler.CSS.Dom/CssStyleEngine.Values.cs     | 512 +++++++++++++++----
 2 files changed, 513 insertions(+), 109 deletions(-)

